    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a B2B lead-qualification assistant. Analyze this inbound lead and respond ONLY with valid JSON matching the required schema.\n\nLead details:\n- Company: {{ $json.company }}\n- Email domain: {{ $json.domain }}\n- Message: {{ $json.message }}\n- Source: {{ $json.source }}\n\nTasks:\n1. Classify the company size band from context clues in the message and company name (startup (1-10), small (11-50), medium (51-200), large (201-1000), enterprise (1000+)). If unclear, infer conservatively and note the uncertainty in your reasoning.\n2. Classify the industry/vertical in a few words.\n3. Score this lead's sales-readiness and fit from 1 (poor fit / spam-like) to 100 (excellent, ready-to-buy), based on message intent, specificity, urgency, and company signals.\n4. Give a concise 1-2 sentence reasoning for the score.\n\nRespond with JSON only.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "chain-classify-score",
      "name": "Classify & Score Lead",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        -500,
        60
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
